OL,3,ABombshell confession in The Traitors as
OL,4,Afaithfuls finally turn the screw
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from episode nine of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FWith the traitors still riding high
OL,11,Ffollowing last Friday's episode, could
OL,12,Fthey really just walk it to the final?
OL,13,FIt was time to find out.
OL,15,FHaving been bestowed with the almighty
OL,16,Fpower of the double dagger - well,
OL,17,Fmetaphorically speaking, at least -
OL,18,FKing Kenny held all the cards, choosing
OL,19,Fto use his special power of a double
OL,20,Fvote to send another faithful packing.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
